**Hypothesis:**  
If there is at least one empty fila before a pirate appears, the player can use that empty round to place a cannon and then, on the next round, merge a second cannon onto the same column before the pirate’s first shot. This yields a damage‑2 cannon in time to kill an HP‑5 pirate within its three‑shot window, making the level winnable; without the preceding empty fila the same pirate would be unwinnable.

