Cannon damage can increase without limit through successive merges; each merge adds the absorbed cannon’s damage to the moving cannon, so a cannon can reach damage > 3 and thereby kill any HP pirate within its three‑shot window as long as the accumulated damage ≥ the pirate’s HP.

